<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>zh-Hans</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_PACKAGE_TYPE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
	<true/>
	<key>CFBundleLocalizations</key>
	<array>
		<string>zh-Hans</string>
		<string>en</string>
		<string>ja</string>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>Himawari</string>
	<key>HimawariReleaseChannel</key>
	<string>$(HIMAWARI_RELEASE_CHANNEL)</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>扫电脑上 Himawari 设置里的配对码</string>
	<key>NSFaceIDUsageDescription</key>
	<string>改动 Himawari 里的设置和记忆前确认是你本人</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>到了一个地方、停了多久会记下来，存在你自己的服务器上。</string>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>不打开 Himawari 也记下你到了哪、停了多久，存在你自己的服务器上。</string>
	<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>把日历里的安排同步到你自己的服务器上，日历里删了，那边也删。</string>
	<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
	<string>读步数、睡眠、心率和锻炼，存在你自己的服务器上。</string>
	<key>NSMotionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>记下你在走路、跑步还是开车，存在你自己的服务器上。</string>
	<key>NSContactsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>把联系人的名字、电话、邮箱和生日同步到你自己的服务器上，让它认得你认识的人。</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>记下新拍的照片和截屏的时间、地点，不传照片本身。</string>
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>location</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIApplicationSceneManifest</key>
	<dict>
		<key>UIApplicationSupportsMultipleScenes</key>
		<false/>
	</dict>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict/>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
